  "description": "This receipt is a thermal point-of-sale (POS) receipt issued by O!Save, located at Jl. Teluk Gong Raya, Penjagalan, Jakarta, Indonesia. The header includes the store branding, branch address, and the company's tax identification number (NPWP). The receipt contains an itemized retail transaction section and concludes with a financial summary showing the Subtotal (inclusive of PPN), Rounding Adjustment (Pembulatan), Total (Jumlah), Cash (Tunai), and Change (Kembalian), along with the total number of purchased items. The footer records the transaction reference number, transaction date and time, store operating hours, the O!Save Warranty return policy, and a customer appreciation message. This receipt represents a standard Indonesian retail POS receipt featuring transaction metadata, tax-inclusive pricing, cash payment reconciliation, store policy information, and business identification.",
